  exerciseNumber: 15
  exerciseName: FirePitConsumesAllWood
  exerciseTitle: Fire Pit consumes all Wood
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/64202481
  exerciseText: Fire Pit consumes all wood at once.
  hintText: What is happening to the woodAmount? And the progress timer?
  solutionText: The progress timer is not being reset, so when it goes under 0 it
    consumes 1 wood per frame. It needs progress = progressMax;
